          { "type": "text", "style": "h2", "text": "1. GENERAL" },
          { "type": "text", "style": "h3", "text": "1.1 Description of the control work" },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "p",
            "text": "This static control plan covers the control for the execution of the construction section mentioned on the front page and associated works."
          },
          { "type": "text", "style": "p", "text": "The inspection is carried out in accordance with the building designer's:" },
          { "type": "text", "style": "h3", "text": "LISTING DOCUMENT CONSTRUCTION PART: ACCOMPLISHMENT" },
          {
            "type": "dynamic",
            "style": "dynamic",
            "field": "b2StaticControlPlanLine",
            "defaultText": "B2. X number STATIC CONTROL PLAN Special text"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "p",
            "text": "The focus is on seeing between the construction designer's material and the execution of the construction section on the site."
          },
          { "type": "text", "style": "p", "text": "The following forms the basis for the checks carried out:" },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "style": "list",
            "items": [
              "Building Regulations 2018 - BR18",
              "SBI 271 \"Documentation and Control of Load-Bearing Structures\"",
              "DS/EN 1990 DK NA:2021, Annex B5",
              "DS 1140:2019 \"Execution of load-bearing structures – General control\"",
              "DS/INF 1140:2022 \"Guide to DS 1140\""
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
  
      {
        "pageNumber": 6,
