            "type": "dynamic",
            "style": "dynamic",
            "field": "constructionClassLine",
            "defaultText": "The structure is classified as construction class KKX"
          },
          { "type": "text", "style": "p", "text": "Self-monitoring and independent control of the work carried out are carried out." },
          { "type": "text", "style": "p", "text": "There is no requirement for third-party control." },
          { "type": "text", "style": "h3", "text": "Self-monitoring" },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "p",
            "text": "The self-inspection of the execution is carried out by the person who carried out the construction when the construction or parts thereof are completed."
